          <zone fixed-size='522' forceUpdate='true' h='7491' id='109' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='27605' x='5214' y='1930'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Condensed Light' fontsize='18'>E-COMMERCE EXECUTIVE DASHBOARD</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Financial Summary and Performance</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='973' forceUpdate='true' h='7491' id='647' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='51094' x='32819' y='1930'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555'>Insights &amp; Recommendations:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555'> In 2018, Gross Revenue (+22.11%) and GMV (+21.05%) shifted into a steadier run rate, though Freight-Price Ratio climbed +6.21% to 17.03%. Credit Cards (78.8%) and Boleto (16.8%, 33.23-hr lag) anchored payments, while Instant Cash Ratio jumped 46.39% to 4.37% and 7-10+ installments held 25.16% of GMV risk (R$ 2.07M). Financial leakage fell to 0.61% (Boleto non-payment -53.31% to 9.55%) despite a July spike (at R$17.5K, 1.95%), and Net Cash realization hit 97.91 (lowest recorded in Fashion Female Clothing at 89.95%). Recommend to set tiered free-shipping thresholds, incentivize short-term/immediate payments, automate Boleto reminders, and audit high-leakage category promotions.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='24' h='7491' id='648' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='1667' x='83913' y='1930'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
