                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='522' forceUpdate='true' h='7491' id='109' type-v2='text' w='27605' x='5214' y='1930'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Roboto Condensed Light' fontsize='18'>E-COMMERCE EXECUTIVE DASHBOARD</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Customer Satisfaction and Review Performance</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='973' forceUpdate='true' h='7491' id='629' type-v2='text' w='51094' x='32819' y='1930'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Insights &amp; Recommendations</run>
                    <run>: Average Review Score held steady at 4.09 (+0.07 YoY) across 52,749 customers (+20.67 YoY), though Repeat Purchase Rate fell 23.00% to 2.21% as Recent Standard (46.27%) and Lapsed/At-Risk (46.19%) buyers dominated the mix. Severe 8+ day delivery delays drove 1,211 1-star reviews (peaking in Feb to March at 15-51% to 17.47% 1-star friction) and hitting Lapsed/At-Risk buyers hardest (3.92 rating, 15.02% 1-star) while Home Comfort 2 (2.40 rating, 42.86% 1-star), and 7-10+ installments (13.06% 1-star) trailed. It is recommended to deploy win-back campaigns for Lapsed buyers, tighten Carrier SLAs on bulky items/RJ lanes, and set expectations on long-term installment orders.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
