                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2778' id='625' type-v2='text' w='14115' x='5729' y='26944'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Customer Satisfaction and Review Performance</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4908' id='744' type-v2='text' w='22708' x='49688' y='27964'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Nationwide KPIs &amp; Geographic Bottlenecks:  </run>
                    <run>Benchmarks Late Delivery Rate, Fulfillment Lead Time, and On-Time In-Full (OTIF) rates against prior-year baselines, paired with a state heat map highlighting severe regional friction.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4908' id='735' type-v2='text' w='20885' x='26198' y='28149'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Topline Demand &amp; Freight Trajectory:  </run>
                    <run>Tracks YoY performance across Gross Revenue, GMV, Average Freight Value, and Freight-to-Price ratios to separate pure product demand from shipping cost inflation.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4908' id='753' type-v2='text' w='22708' x='74948' y='28241'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Retention &amp; Customer Lifecycle:  </run>
                    <run>Pairs top-level volume, CSAT, and repeat purchase KPIs with an RFM segmentation breakdown </run>
                    <run italic='true'>(see RFM customer segmentation rules) </run>
                    <run>and monthly 1-star friction trajectories</run>
                    <run italic='true'>.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='6481' id='677' type-v2='dashboard-object' w='3646' x='1094' y='31850'>
                  <button action='tabdoc:goto-sheet window-id=&quot;{4DC2589A-DFC3-4EE6-A274-1993C992841E}&quot;'>
                    <button-visual-state>
                      <image-path>Image/Info-removebg-preview.png</image-path>
                    </button-visual-state>
                  </button>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='68' forceUpdate='true' h='7037' id='745' type-v2='text' w='22708' x='49688' y='32872'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Root-Cause &amp; Category Friction:  P</run>
                    <run>artitions delayed orders between Seller Dispatch Delays and Carrier Transit Delays, while ranking the highest-delay product categories and worst-performing interstate shipping corridors by volume and late delivery rate.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='67' forceUpdate='true' h='6945' id='736' type-v2='text' w='20885' x='26198' y='33057'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Payment &amp; Installment Mechanics: </run>
                    <run>Breaks down transaction volume across Credit Card, Boleto Bancário, Voucher, and Debit Card alongside Boleto settlement lag, instant cash ratios, and high-risk long-term installment exposure in 7-10+ installments</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4908' id='754' type-v2='text' w='22708' x='74948' y='33149'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Delay Tolerance &amp; Payment Correlation:  </run>
                    <run>Maps star rating distributions against delivery delay brackets to pinpoint exact customer tolerance tipping points, alongside CSAT performance across payment types and installment tiers.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2778' id='685' type-v2='text' w='14115' x='5729' y='33519'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Project Scope - Data Dictionary &amp; Key Calculations</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4908' id='755' type-v2='text' w='22708' x='74948' y='38057'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Product &amp; Regional Sentiment Outliers:  </run>
                    <run>Contrasts the Top 5 highest-rated and Bottom 5 most friction-heavy product categories alongside state-level CSAT rankings.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
